---
// src/pages/index.astro
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>The Believeland Beat</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <h1>THE BELIEVELAND BEAT</h1>
      <nav>
        <a href="/">NFL</a>
        <a href="/">MLB</a>
        <a href="/">CULTURE</a>
        <a href="/">FOOD</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      <!-- Hero Section -->
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-image">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508344928928-7137b29de216?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Baseball field" />
        </div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h2>The Stoic Isolation of the Late-Inning Closer</h2>
          <p>When the bullpen door swings open, the quantitative edges fade. It's just one man, the mound, and the sheer existential weight of the ninth inning.</p>
          <span class="author">By The Editor</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Grid Section -->
      <div class="divider"></div>
      
      <section class="article-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Tailgate Masterclass: The Two-Zone Delmonico</h3>
          <p>Forget the cheap hot dogs. Why dry-brining a 5.08 cm (~2 in) thick ribeye and mastering two-zone indirect cooking is the only acceptable pre-game ritual.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>By the Numbers: The AL Central Squeeze</h3>
          <p>Stress-testing the mathematical reliability of the Guardians' current rotation against the remaining divisional schedule.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Le Samouraï on the Gridiron</h3>
          <p>How the cold, calculating precision of classic French cinema mirrors the ideal pocket presence of a franchise quarterback.</p>
        </article>
        
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Cuyahoga Ledges: A Saturday Escape</h3>
          <p>Getting away from the screens and stadium lights with a day trip hike through the waterfalls and stone structures of the Valley.</p>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --bg-color: #ffffff;
    --text-main: #111111;
    --text-muted: #555555;
    --accent: #d83b01; 
  }
  
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .site-header {
    background-color: #111;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .site-header h1 {
    margin: 0 0 15px 0;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .site-header nav a {
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin: 0 15px;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .site-header nav a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .hero {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .hero-image {
      flex: 2;
    }
    .hero-content {
      flex: 1;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
  }

  .hero-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    background-color: #eee;
  }

  .hero-content h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    margin: 0 0 15px 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .hero-content p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 15px 0;
  }

  .author {
    font-weight: bold;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .divider {
    height: 4px;
    background-color: #111;
    margin: 40px 0;
  }

  .article-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .article-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .article-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .card p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>